        "slc_8960bb9b4b31bb9c86abba8896e454404c5966e6aad7c5f906d8a25a3964733d"
      ],
      "text": "Built-in tool paths include Read, Write, Edit, MultiEdit, Grep, Glob, Bash, Todo, Diff, and Git, with file writes and commands passing through permission, path, security, and result-summary boundaries."
    },
